;
Hexa-histidine tagged M1-linked di-ubiquitin, in which two ubiquitin molecules 
are linked via a peptide bond between the carboxyl group of Gly76 of the distal 
ubiquitin (chain B) and the Met1 of the proximal ubiquitin (chain A).
;
